WEBVTT

00:01:42.740 --> 00:01:43.540
Old one,

00:01:44.720 --> 00:01:46.750
do you speak the truth?

00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:47.450
Yes.

00:01:48.010 --> 00:01:53.640
A merchant from our country has been arrested by the Imperial Army's S.S. III.

00:01:54.720 --> 00:01:56.450
Smuggling, I see.

00:01:56.450 --> 00:01:57.630
Precisely.

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:00.620
This could be quite useful.

00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:07.420
Imperial Army S.S. III was Alice's unit, right?

00:02:14.910 --> 00:02:17.430
Princess Septième has entered the Empire?!

00:02:17.430 --> 00:02:18.390
Yeah.

00:02:18.390 --> 00:02:20.410
She'll be on a train arriving around noon.

00:02:20.870 --> 00:02:22.370
A princess?

00:02:23.030 --> 00:02:24.590
Septième Loderia,

00:02:25.530 --> 00:02:29.580
one of the seven siblings and successors to Loderia's throne.

00:02:29.940 --> 00:02:32.080
A princess from a neighboring country sneaking in...

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:35.110
A royal getaway... that's so admirable...

00:02:35.590 --> 00:02:38.290
This princess doesn't behave like that.

00:02:38.840 --> 00:02:40.930
Oh, you know this princess?

00:02:41.930 --> 00:02:45.020
Through my grandfather's connections, I've met her on a number of occasions.

00:02:46.390 --> 00:02:48.270
And, what is the purpose of her visit?

00:02:49.450 --> 00:02:52.300
Remember that smuggler we uncovered sometime ago?

00:02:53.300 --> 00:02:55.730
He's a national of Loderia, apparently.

00:02:59.710 --> 00:03:04.160
She's probably here to seek gratitude from the higher-ups in the army involved in this scandal.

00:03:05.010 --> 00:03:08.870
Royalty from that country all want to take advantage of this.

00:03:19.740 --> 00:03:22.510
There should be a carriage here to transport us.

00:03:22.510 --> 00:03:23.720
Let it wait.

00:03:24.320 --> 00:03:26.090
There is a place I wish to go to beforehand.

00:03:26.450 --> 00:03:27.670
But Princess!

00:03:27.670 --> 00:03:28.930
This is a secret trip,

00:03:29.280 --> 00:03:31.190
in other words, a secret mission.

00:03:31.190 --> 00:03:32.390
I've heard that four times already...

00:03:33.010 --> 00:03:34.710
once when we left the palace,

00:03:34.710 --> 00:03:36.260
once before we exited the country,

00:03:36.260 --> 00:03:37.800
once during supper,

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:40.860
and lastly when I woke up this morning at 7:05!

00:03:41.250 --> 00:03:44.320
We must find a weakness of the Empire!

00:03:44.670 --> 00:03:46.700
I've heard you say that thirteen times!

00:03:47.030 --> 00:03:49.120
I will repeat it no matter how many times it takes!

00:03:49.600 --> 00:03:52.900
You must do whatever it takes to give you
an advantage to succeeding to the throne-

00:03:54.610 --> 00:03:56.220
Looks like I missed out on the hot dog...

00:03:57.020 --> 00:03:58.750
Is there something wrong with the wall over there?

00:03:59.730 --> 00:04:01.800
There was a hot dog stand there before.

00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:04.420
Hot dog?!

00:04:04.420 --> 00:04:10.100
Princess, royalty must never, ever eat such lowly commoner food-

00:04:11.700 --> 00:04:13.330
I looked around, but I didn't find it...

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:16.330
...that black and white checkered hot dog stand.

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:20.420
Darn it, that was the best one around here.

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:22.510
Not just that store.

00:04:23.330 --> 00:04:25.350
Compared to the time right after the end of the war,

00:04:25.350 --> 00:04:27.300
the number of stands there have dropped a lot.

00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:29.940
Hey, they weren't taxed back then.

00:04:30.440 --> 00:04:34.790
Probably they're all getting into dirty business somewhere right now.

00:04:34.810 --> 00:04:35.220
"Armeemanagementverhaftung" is German for "Army Leadership Arrest"
"Diebstahlsvorfall" is German for "Theft Incident"

00:04:35.220 --> 00:04:39.550
"One step closer to exposing
the corruption of military leaders."

00:04:40.470 --> 00:04:42.150
Isn't this about Section III?

00:04:45.590 --> 00:04:47.440
Look, we finally got a day off.

00:04:48.030 --> 00:04:50.060
Forget about work, would 'ya?

00:04:50.660 --> 00:04:51.550
You're right.

00:04:52.040 --> 00:04:54.520
I hope the corporal's resting up, too.

00:04:54.890 --> 00:04:58.180
Oh, I'm sure of that.

00:04:58.180 --> 00:04:59.940
He's in "intensive care".

00:05:18.030 --> 00:05:20.130
It's time to get your urine sample.

00:05:24.680 --> 00:05:26.650
Gosh! This one broke, too?!

00:05:27.410 --> 00:05:28.500
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:05:31.910 --> 00:05:33.340
Allow me to introduce you!

00:05:33.340 --> 00:05:34.620
This is Rose.

00:05:34.620 --> 00:05:36.060
It's Rosanna!

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:37.800
Yeah, Rosanna.

00:05:38.260 --> 00:05:39.400
She's cute, isn't she?

00:05:39.750 --> 00:05:42.360
I picked her up while you were running around looking.

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:47.660
It's the first time I've ridden on one of these!

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:49.990
Well then...

00:05:50.660 --> 00:05:54.020
You should have fun with girls some time!

00:06:02.270 --> 00:06:03.750
Damn that Oreld!

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:07.850
There's no way I can speak to ladies-

00:06:09.570 --> 00:06:10.840
Conserving water, eh?

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:15.790
The army's water usage is unlimited,

00:06:15.790 --> 00:06:18.200
but it's still like this for the public.

00:06:18.890 --> 00:06:22.550
Oh shoot, I need to stop thinking about work.

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:26.280
Well, well, a commoner's toilet.

00:06:30.880 --> 00:06:32.530
Ah, don't mind me and continue.

00:06:32.940 --> 00:06:34.790
I'm not interested in commoner physiology.

00:06:40.020 --> 00:06:42.800
That's not bad clothing coordination for a commoner.

00:06:43.820 --> 00:06:45.090
I commend you.

00:06:45.090 --> 00:06:46.380
Who are you?!

00:06:48.280 --> 00:06:49.290
Who, you ask?

00:06:49.790 --> 00:06:52.430
Normally, I wouldn't tell my name to commoners,

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:53.680
but consider this instance for fun.

00:06:55.760 --> 00:06:57.730
My name is Septième,

00:06:58.190 --> 00:07:03.110
one of the seven children whose ambition is to succeed to Loderia's throne!

00:07:03.580 --> 00:07:06.720
Oh, thank god there's water over in the basin.

00:07:07.290 --> 00:07:08.610
ARE YOU LISTENING?!

00:07:09.110 --> 00:07:11.820
Yes, yes, my princess.

00:07:12.580 --> 00:07:13.630
I'm Machs,

00:07:14.340 --> 00:07:16.500
and what are you doing in a place like this, little princess?

00:07:18.710 --> 00:07:21.100
I am currently running away.

00:07:21.970 --> 00:07:24.600
My butler is being extremely noisy...

00:07:24.600 --> 00:07:26.680
saying the same things over and over again.

00:07:27.590 --> 00:07:30.660
I remember things after hearing them once.

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:32.660
And thus, here I am!

00:07:35.330 --> 00:07:37.820
I think I should take her to the police...

00:07:39.600 --> 00:07:41.700
Hey, you sure you don't want to go home?

00:07:42.260 --> 00:07:45.250
That butler of yours is probably worried sick right now.

00:07:45.700 --> 00:07:47.600
Forget about him.

00:07:47.600 --> 00:07:49.570
I cannot believe he just let me get away so easily.

00:07:54.150 --> 00:07:55.840
Anyway, would you like something to eat?

00:07:56.720 --> 00:08:00.410
But I don't think I can give a princess a hot dog...

00:08:01.090 --> 00:08:01.970
Hot dog?

00:08:02.630 --> 00:08:04.370
The one with a black and white checkered roof?

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:06.840
You know that place?

00:08:06.840 --> 00:08:08.880
Last time I came by,

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:11.010
there was a good smell coming from that place.

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:17.100
Most important of all, I was very interested in
the barbaric action of eating food in the street.

00:08:20.380 --> 00:08:22.730
I used to buy from there...

00:08:22.730 --> 00:08:25.430
...but it seems like they've moved.

00:08:26.280 --> 00:08:27.090
I see...

00:08:27.760 --> 00:08:29.650
I don't know where to start looking for it, either.

00:08:31.060 --> 00:08:32.240
The way you walk...

00:08:32.670 --> 00:08:33.410
Machs!

00:08:34.490 --> 00:08:36.700
You're a soldier, aren't you?

00:08:38.210 --> 00:08:39.410
Uh, yeah...

00:08:39.990 --> 00:08:41.530
That makes things easier.

00:08:42.670 --> 00:08:45.260
Ah, hey, wait!

00:08:51.330 --> 00:08:52.880
Princess!!!

00:08:52.880 --> 00:08:56.970
Gosh... where did she go?

00:09:01.110 --> 00:09:02.430
Ah, we're sorry,

00:09:02.430 --> 00:09:06.600
but we can't let outsiders just see our registration list.

00:09:07.230 --> 00:09:08.410
Yeah, you're right.

00:09:08.870 --> 00:09:10.610
Don't give in so easily!

00:09:11.060 --> 00:09:12.080
But...

00:09:12.080 --> 00:09:12.950
Are you sure?

00:09:13.390 --> 00:09:15.780
Machs is a soldier, an officer even.

00:09:16.660 --> 00:09:20.860
I heard that soldiers hold quite a bit of influence in politics in this country.

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:26.740
Isn't that Sergeant Major Machs?

00:09:26.740 --> 00:09:28.960
Ah, thanks about the other day.

00:09:29.310 --> 00:09:30.940
What's the matter?

00:09:31.630 --> 00:09:32.540
Well...

00:09:33.940 --> 00:09:36.050
Ah, don't worry.

00:09:36.700 --> 00:09:43.150
We exchange information with
this person when collecting taxes.

00:09:45.310 --> 00:09:48.420
So their booth license got taken away since they weren't paying taxes.

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:51.150
What a harsh world...

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:53.260
As a person from Section III,

00:09:53.260 --> 00:09:55.050
you should have good connections in the tax office.

00:09:56.230 --> 00:09:57.630
Yet, why did you not give your name?

00:09:58.220 --> 00:10:00.560
Well, they're different things...

00:10:00.560 --> 00:10:03.740
You should use everything that's to your advantage or the opponent's weak points.

00:10:04.430 --> 00:10:06.160
That's the way things go.

00:10:06.470 --> 00:10:07.490
"To my advantage"...

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:10.330
Kids shouldn't be saying stuff like that.

00:10:11.220 --> 00:10:13.450
Have you seen Loderia's national flag?

00:10:17.270 --> 00:10:19.380
It has a bunch of grapes on it, right?

00:10:19.880 --> 00:10:22.300
Every one of those grapes is a child.

00:10:23.050 --> 00:10:24.940
Give birth to many children...

00:10:24.940 --> 00:10:26.250
...and have them compete against each other.

00:10:27.030 --> 00:10:30.400
The most superior one gets to sit on the throne in the middle...

00:10:30.400 --> 00:10:31.650
...and rule the country.

00:10:32.600 --> 00:10:35.000
Using schemes and strategies, they clash with each other.

00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:36.770
Sometimes even assassinations are attempted.

00:10:39.520 --> 00:10:42.660
Note: This is French for "Castle of the Raisins of Dusk"
Chateau des Raisins du Crepuscule...

00:10:43.340 --> 00:10:46.720
The child towers of the castle are spread about like raisins...

00:10:46.720 --> 00:10:49.460
...and each child is isolated and raised in a different tower.

00:10:50.170 --> 00:10:53.220
Each day is spent creating strategies to bring down siblings,

00:10:54.650 --> 00:10:58.010
while the only time the whole family gathers together is at supper,

00:10:58.820 --> 00:11:01.350
along with a poison taster.

00:11:02.750 --> 00:11:05.200
You use others or you get used by others...

00:11:05.700 --> 00:11:08.870
That law is the same whether amongst the nobility or commoners!

00:11:11.930 --> 00:11:13.820
A pointless speech I gave...

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:15.800
Let's go, Machs.

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:17.760
Go? Where to?

00:11:18.140 --> 00:11:21.450
The store owner's address was on that registration list.

00:11:21.920 --> 00:11:23.530
What, you're going to knock on his door?

00:11:23.530 --> 00:11:24.410
Yes!

00:11:24.410 --> 00:11:27.500
Let them know that no one can get away from me!

00:11:29.700 --> 00:11:31.250
Maybe she's being considerate of me...

00:11:32.760 --> 00:11:34.540
Her emotions are that of a child's,

00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:37.420
but her way of thinking is very strict.

00:11:39.040 --> 00:11:42.720
Ah, she's a bit like the lieutenant.

00:11:47.320 --> 00:11:50.130
So, you're telling us to search for your princess.

00:11:50.130 --> 00:11:52.430
I'm saying it for your sake.

00:11:52.980 --> 00:11:56.200
If something were to happen to the princess, this would be an international problem.

00:11:56.820 --> 00:11:58.850
At least ask us more nicely...

00:11:58.850 --> 00:12:00.000
Did you say something?

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:00.930
Oh, no.

00:12:01.520 --> 00:12:04.060
2nd Lieutenant, listen to what he has to say.

00:12:04.790 --> 00:12:05.570
Yes, sir.

00:12:06.860 --> 00:12:07.690
Uhh...

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:11.850
That was a longer trip than expected.

00:12:12.250 --> 00:12:15.370
Yeah... and the transportation fee is crazy, too.

00:12:17.400 --> 00:12:19.860
What an atrocious place.

00:12:20.720 --> 00:12:23.090
That's because we're pretty close to 0-Land.

00:12:23.550 --> 00:12:24.690
What's that?

00:12:25.160 --> 00:12:26.400
Well, basically...

00:12:27.100 --> 00:12:29.660
A pretty dangerous and outlaw area...

00:12:30.140 --> 00:12:31.340
A danger zone, eh?

00:12:31.790 --> 00:12:34.150
We'll be fine as long as we don't go in too deep.

00:12:38.740 --> 00:12:40.440
This fragrant smell is...
This fragrant smell is...

00:12:45.400 --> 00:12:46.350
We found it!
We found it!

00:12:48.050 --> 00:12:49.330
Here 'ya go!

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:53.650
You came all the way down here to eat my hot dogs...

00:12:53.650 --> 00:12:54.830
That makes me damn happy.

00:12:58.240 --> 00:13:00.460
Yeah, I'm starving, too!

00:13:00.460 --> 00:13:03.220
Like, my stomach's about to jump out my back.

00:13:03.720 --> 00:13:06.700
Well, let's get eating-

00:13:09.670 --> 00:13:11.880
You're... not going to eat?

00:13:11.880 --> 00:13:13.310
Ah, no, I...

00:13:20.560 --> 00:13:22.300
Don't worry; it tastes great.

00:13:22.300 --> 00:13:23.740
Go on and eat before it gets cold.

00:13:34.020 --> 00:13:36.290
Rough yet delicious, indeed.

00:13:36.800 --> 00:13:38.820
Okay, we're going to be walking back...

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:40.870
By the way, owner.

00:13:41.360 --> 00:13:43.790
How about you consider treating us to this?

00:13:44.210 --> 00:13:45.970
Th-That's quite a joke there...

00:13:46.500 --> 00:13:49.340
Your license to do business should have been taken away.

00:13:49.810 --> 00:13:51.840
Have you given the tax you haven't paid yet?

00:13:52.740 --> 00:13:55.900
Sergeant Major Machs here belongs in Imperial Army S.S. III.

00:13:56.460 --> 00:14:01.610
In other words, collecting taxes and arresting people for doing illegal business are within his powers.

00:14:03.480 --> 00:14:06.660
Don't use Section III's name for purposes like that!

00:14:06.660 --> 00:14:09.220
I was just being thoughtful for you-

00:14:09.220 --> 00:14:11.260
Always taking advantage of other's weak points...

00:14:11.260 --> 00:14:13.200
You can't enjoy your life living like that, right?!

00:14:15.920 --> 00:14:17.860
You think I enjoy it?

00:14:19.610 --> 00:14:22.130
If I show weakness, I won't be able to live.

00:14:23.100 --> 00:14:26.130
My food was poisoned on my fifth birthday...

00:14:26.860 --> 00:14:28.050
...by my own brothers...

00:14:28.570 --> 00:14:29.930
...by my own sisters...

00:14:31.020 --> 00:14:33.830
My taster died for me...

00:14:34.950 --> 00:14:37.410
If I show weakness, I die!

00:14:38.080 --> 00:14:39.410
They demonstrated that for me...

00:14:40.710 --> 00:14:43.190
I'm reminded of it every time I eat...

00:14:43.740 --> 00:14:45.640
I can't forget about it even if I want to...

00:14:46.500 --> 00:14:49.280
My mind just won't forget about anything!!!

00:14:51.030 --> 00:14:52.200
Septième...

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:53.910
Don't touch me!!!

00:14:54.900 --> 00:14:55.780
Septième!

00:14:56.230 --> 00:14:59.160
Sir, the direction the girl ran in is...

00:14:59.880 --> 00:15:00.840
...towards 0-Land...

00:15:05.150 --> 00:15:06.480
0-Land...

00:15:07.010 --> 00:15:08.550
The princess is there?

00:15:08.980 --> 00:15:10.660
According to witnesses.

00:15:11.550 --> 00:15:12.220
This isn't good.

00:15:13.490 --> 00:15:14.510
H-Hurry!

00:15:14.510 --> 00:15:16.560
If we don't, this will become an international problem!

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:17.920
Understood!

00:15:20.380 --> 00:15:23.580
Please, drive safely!!!

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:27.760
That's so unlike me.

00:15:28.520 --> 00:15:30.540
I lost control of my emotions over a commoner.

00:15:30.540 --> 00:15:31.510
How shameful...

00:15:39.340 --> 00:15:43.070
Oh, not only are her clothes elegant, but so is her hair.

00:15:43.760 --> 00:15:46.120
We can finally get a good meal now.

00:15:50.790 --> 00:15:51.600
Damn it!

00:15:52.620 --> 00:15:55.000
I am a princess of the Loderia Royal Family!

00:15:55.000 --> 00:15:56.350
This will become a diplomatic problem for your country!

00:15:57.040 --> 00:15:58.140
A princess?

00:15:58.680 --> 00:16:01.350
Then we can sell you for an even higher price now.

00:16:03.060 --> 00:16:05.290
They're so low that they don't fear people at the top?

00:16:06.100 --> 00:16:07.450
Looks like I have no choice but...

00:16:09.340 --> 00:16:11.090
My companion is a soldier.

00:16:11.590 --> 00:16:14.030
Even you people fear soldiers.

00:16:19.580 --> 00:16:22.020
Soldiers won't come here!

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:27.190
This area, like its name, doesn't even have a number associated with it.

00:16:27.740 --> 00:16:29.770
People here don't even have citizenship,

00:16:29.770 --> 00:16:31.610
nor are there any laws protecting us.

00:16:32.490 --> 00:16:37.420
On the flip side, killing a soldier here wouldn't be a problem.

00:16:38.890 --> 00:16:42.560
So, who would come to save you here?

00:16:46.130 --> 00:16:47.040
Are you okay?

00:16:47.040 --> 00:16:47.770
Machs!

00:16:48.230 --> 00:16:50.510
We got a daredevil here!

00:16:50.510 --> 00:16:51.430
Get out of here now!

00:16:51.830 --> 00:16:52.610
Hurry!

00:16:53.360 --> 00:16:54.050
Forgive me...

00:16:54.910 --> 00:16:57.640
I haven't been able to move my legs...

00:16:58.460 --> 00:16:59.270
Forgive me...

00:17:00.090 --> 00:17:01.120
Forgive me...

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:02.570
Oh, great.

00:17:03.180 --> 00:17:05.620
You're really like a princess now.

00:17:06.880 --> 00:17:08.340
Machs, you-

00:17:09.990 --> 00:17:11.130
Machs, behind you!

00:17:13.300 --> 00:17:13.970
Machs!

00:17:14.550 --> 00:17:16.320
Is this your buddy?

00:17:16.830 --> 00:17:19.510
He's pretty delicate for a soldier.

00:17:19.920 --> 00:17:22.220
Machs is not delicate!

00:17:23.130 --> 00:17:24.350
Is that so?

00:17:25.890 --> 00:17:27.650
It's not over yet!

00:17:31.920 --> 00:17:33.110
Why you!!!

00:17:36.400 --> 00:17:37.780
C'mon, hurry!

00:17:42.440 --> 00:17:43.540
Princess!

00:17:47.600 --> 00:17:49.750
She's a real princess?

00:17:50.090 --> 00:17:51.710
Apparently.

00:17:51.710 --> 00:17:54.690
One false step and it could've become a diplomatic problem.

00:18:11.710 --> 00:18:14.030
We will get straight to business.

00:18:14.420 --> 00:18:17.810
Our country requests that you hand over the merchant in question.

00:18:18.640 --> 00:18:22.940
Putting our citizens in unjust custody is a disgrace to our country's pride!

00:18:23.380 --> 00:18:24.290
With all due respect-

00:18:24.970 --> 00:18:27.690
Long time no see, Alice L. Malvin.

00:18:30.580 --> 00:18:35.340
The smuggler in question is an important witness for exposing corruption in our army.

00:18:36.150 --> 00:18:39.830
Handing him over just like that would be to our country's loss.

00:18:40.730 --> 00:18:41.990
So...

00:18:41.990 --> 00:18:46.920
You're giving our citizens trouble in order to deal with your own trouble?

00:18:48.080 --> 00:18:51.200
We will handle the investigation of this merchant.

00:18:51.200 --> 00:18:52.930
Hand him over immediately.

00:18:53.620 --> 00:18:55.850
2nd Lieutenant, what is your response?

00:18:56.540 --> 00:18:59.530
Or are you saying you don't mind making this a diplomatic incident?

00:18:59.970 --> 00:19:02.520
You haven't changed at all, Alice.

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:05.860
No wonder you have raised such fine subordinates.

00:19:06.470 --> 00:19:09.840
Investigate the smuggler as much as you want.

00:19:10.200 --> 00:19:11.830
Princess, what are you saying-

00:19:11.830 --> 00:19:12.520
Silence!

00:19:12.520 --> 00:19:13.210
Yes, your highness.

00:19:13.210 --> 00:19:14.630
Why, thank you.

00:19:15.180 --> 00:19:17.760
So, what should we give you in return?

00:19:18.250 --> 00:19:19.970
Right, let's see...

00:19:19.970 --> 00:19:19.980
I shall have this, then.

00:19:19.980 --> 00:19:21.760
Maybe something from the S.S.-
I shall have this, then.

00:19:21.760 --> 00:19:21.970
Maybe something from the S.S.-

00:19:28.120 --> 00:19:30.810
Yes, just like a commoner,

00:19:31.400 --> 00:19:33.190
rough yet delicious.

00:19:33.930 --> 00:19:37.290
In my future trips to the capital,

00:19:37.290 --> 00:19:40.990
I shall demand the services of Sergeant Major Machs to be at my disposal during that period.

00:19:41.370 --> 00:19:46.120
One subordinate in exchange for saving the Empire face;
we sure have to pay a steep price.

00:19:46.490 --> 00:19:47.040
Yes.

00:19:48.670 --> 00:19:49.690
We're leaving.

00:19:49.690 --> 00:19:50.870
P-Princess!

00:19:56.090 --> 00:19:58.650
Old one, how long are you going to keep pouting?

00:19:58.650 --> 00:19:59.920
Come over here already.

00:20:03.620 --> 00:20:04.640
You've...

00:20:05.830 --> 00:20:07.610
You've become naive...

00:20:08.820 --> 00:20:12.130
Have you lost your ability to take advantage of others now?

00:20:14.070 --> 00:20:16.280
It's too easy to take advantage of others' weaknesses,

00:20:17.290 --> 00:20:19.080
but because it's too easy,

00:20:19.080 --> 00:20:21.460
you won't get anything more than the value of that weakness.

00:20:22.460 --> 00:20:27.070
However, in faithful negotiations,
that standard becomes ambiguous.

00:20:28.060 --> 00:20:30.300
Depending on how the person feels,

00:20:30.300 --> 00:20:32.200
he might obtain something more valuable.

00:20:33.450 --> 00:20:37.020
How much value are you telling me to put in that palm?

00:20:38.410 --> 00:20:40.900
"To draw out an infinite amount of value."

00:20:40.900 --> 00:20:46.700
It is necessary to create bonds like that to achieve my ambitions.

00:20:48.840 --> 00:20:52.300
Yet, you call me naive for trying to take advantage of people's emotions?

00:20:55.190 --> 00:20:56.680
I feel empty.

00:20:58.180 --> 00:21:01.220
There's pretty much nothing
this old body can teach you any more.

00:21:05.430 --> 00:21:06.570
That aside!

00:21:07.010 --> 00:21:10.530
Princess, what exactly do you think a royal's kiss is?

00:21:11.020 --> 00:21:11.830
I kissed him on the cheek.

00:21:12.240 --> 00:21:13.080
Don't worry about it.

00:21:13.570 --> 00:21:16.110
No, I saw it with my eyes!

00:21:16.730 --> 00:21:19.750
That was completely mouth-to-mouth!

00:21:20.220 --> 00:21:20.840
Princess!

00:21:21.510 --> 00:21:22.540
Oh, really?

00:21:23.270 --> 00:21:26.010
My heart was pumping rather fast.

00:21:27.780 --> 00:21:29.400
I don't recall it too well.

00:21:31.620 --> 00:21:33.160
I heard about it, Machs.

00:21:33.540 --> 00:21:34.930
I heard you got a kiss!

00:21:36.360 --> 00:21:38.000
Where did you hear that?

00:21:38.420 --> 00:21:41.640
Oh, time to give Mer-kun a walk!

00:21:42.440 --> 00:21:44.740
A French kiss, even...

00:21:44.740 --> 00:21:45.540
What?!

00:21:45.930 --> 00:21:48.250
You sound like you saw it from close-up or something...

00:21:48.250 --> 00:21:52.030
Oh, shoot, time for my date with Mireille.

00:21:57.110 --> 00:21:58.070
Don't look at me.

00:23:31.130 --> 00:23:33.050
Mer-kun, something happened down in the sewers.

00:23:33.050 --> 00:23:35.140
There's a lot of people suffering there right now,

00:23:35.140 --> 00:23:36.640
and we need to go save them right away!

00:23:36.640 --> 00:23:38.960
But, what is this flame?

00:23:39.790 --> 00:23:42.100
Next time, "The Flame Still Burns".

00:23:42.100 --> 00:23:43.520
Come get us if you're not scared!
